[{"id":3359754657,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IQcmh","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"c66b98c9c7fcdd53c26b2f0e411c05b9b176634a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?u=0565b5d99d54afd5fda6712cd8eb05893572baed&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","login":"dalexeev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359754657","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-21T09:49:02Z"},{"id":3359758249,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IQdep","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","commit_id":"c66b98c9c7fcdd53c26b2f0e411c05b9b176634a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"I think the analysis of the problem is wrong. It's not that `Variant` is inherently missing, it's that variant is called `Nil` in the variant type enum names (I think `Variant::NIL` is supposed to be GDScripts `Variant` but if someone more knowledgeable could confirm this it would be great). In completion it appears under that name:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"505\" height=\"64\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8612161f-2522-4943-8efc-1e2c644421d4\" />\r\n\r\nwhich is obviously wrong.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds `Variant` to the list without handling the wrong `Nil` option.\r\n\r\nA fix should happen in `_find_build_in_variants` which is responsible for adding variant types. \r\n\r\n<sub>Don't be confused by the special case for `Nil` in `_find_build_in_variants` which converts it to `null`. That's an erroneous codepath. This method should not be resposible for adding `null`. There is other code to handle this.</sub>","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359758249","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-21T09:50:05Z"},{"id":3359799437,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7IQniN","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"c66b98c9c7fcdd53c26b2f0e411c05b9b176634a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96520710?u=c2cd79aac227e7e2cbd9473ada955b579c906b8b&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/mu3657","id":96520710,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcDKBg","login":"mu3657","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/mu3657"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3359799437","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-21T10:02:53Z"},{"id":3489696417,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QAIqh","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"f428358c69d0359c62e2a3bcda518971e614d54e","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"LGTM like this. Might be nice to add a test case for it, but I don't see this being very prone to regressions, so it's probably fine.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111878#pullrequestreview-3489696417","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111878","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-20T19:57:36Z"}]